 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 51,
   "description": "I can hear a loaded sled through a gale, but a Crag Snow Leopard gives no warning before it pounces. Kill eight Crag Snow Leopards at night along the sled track in the Frostbarrow Pinewood, which lies in the south of Frostbarrow Shelf. Folk hauling our supplies deserve to arrive with nothing worse to complain of than cold toes.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "giver_name": "Edda Tarnmantle",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarnwatch Fold",
   "id": "frostbarrow_sleds_01",
   "min_level": 21,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 prowling_snow_leopard [in elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/pinewood]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/pinewood",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:prowling_snow_leopard"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "No Bell on Those Cats",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "xp": 540
  },
  {
   "copper": 45,
   "description": "Bank Crabs have taken a liking to the sled landing on the Frostbarrow Shingle south from here, and to the runners of anything parked there. Clear six of them by day if you can spare the time. They only pinch back, but they mean it.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "giver_name": "Edda Tarnmantle",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarnwatch Fold",
   "id": "frostbarrow_sleds_optional",
   "min_level": 21,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 bank_crab [in elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/shingle]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/shingle",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:bank_crab"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "frostbarrow_sleds_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Optional: Pinched Runners",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "xp": 473
  },
  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "Fresh pawprints beside the sled marks, close enough to make my beard bristle. Kill six Crag Snow Leopards in the Frostbarrow Pinewood at night and report back for your bounty. You can repeat it twenty minutes after handing it in.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "giver_name": "Edda Tarnmantle",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarnwatch Fold",
   "id": "frostbarrow_bounty_leopards",
   "min_level": 22,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 prowling_snow_leopard [in elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/pinewood]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/pinewood",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:prowling_snow_leopard"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "frostbarrow_sleds_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Bounty: Pawprints Beside the Runners (repeatable)",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "xp": 270
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Kelda Screesort says Tarncut Mine is managing, which means she's doing three dwarves' work and resenting the other two. Go speak with her there and say Edda sent you. She'll grumble, but she'll find a use for willing hands.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "giver_name": "Edda Tarnmantle",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarnwatch Fold",
   "id": "frostbarrow_sleds_02",
   "min_level": 22,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Kelda Screesort (r20_anchor_061)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_061_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "frostbarrow_sleds_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "An Extra Pair for Kelda",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "xp": 140
  },
  {
   "copper": 45,
   "description": "I spent half the morning hauling a sled back onto the track while a Hill Ram watched me chew my beard. Cull six Hill Rams by day along the haul lane in the Frostbarrow Snowpines, which lie in the heart of Frostbarrow Shelf. They graze quietly until challenged, so take your time choosing the fight; I've already supplied the temper.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "giver_name": "Kelda Screesort",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarncut Mine",
   "id": "frostbarrow_cutting_01",
   "min_level": 23,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 hill_ram [in elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/snowpines]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/snowpines",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:hill_ram"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Horns Have Right of Way",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "xp": 525
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Hedra Rimebell keeps the signal lantern at Rimebell Watch, and she sees trouble on the shore long before it reaches the sleds. Walk up and tell her Edda sent you; a watch with one pair of eyes needs a second pair of hands.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "giver_name": "Edda Tarnmantle",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarnwatch Fold",
   "id": "frostbarrow_sleds_hedra",
   "min_level": 23,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Hedra Rimebell (r20_anchor_026)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_026_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "frostbarrow_sleds_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Lantern at Rimebell",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_026_host",
   "xp": 145
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Every dwarf looks at the ore; a good miner looks at what's holding the roof above it. Bring me four Steel Bars for the deep shaft's brackets. I'll give you a Steel Pickaxe for the rock down there, and we'll both have done something useful before lunch.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "giver_name": "Kelda Screesort",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarncut Mine",
   "id": "frostbarrow_cutting_02",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 4 grug_materials:steel_bar"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 4,
     "item": "grug_materials:steel_bar",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "frostbarrow_cutting_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [
    "grug_materials:pick_steel 1"
   ],
   "title": "What Holds the Roof",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "xp": 465
  },
  {
   "copper": 45,
   "description": "A landing should let you get out of a boat, not persuade you to climb back in. Kill six Barnacle Pinchers on the Frostbarrow Icy Shore southwest from here by day. They'll attack without waiting for an invitation, so get your footing before you get their attention.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_026_host",
   "giver_name": "Hedra Rimebell",
   "giver_settlement": "Rimebell Watch",
   "id": "frostbarrow_watch_01",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 armored_crab [in elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/icy_shore]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_frostbarrow_shelf/icy_shore",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:armored_crab"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Landing Bites Back",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_026_host",
   "xp": 543
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Use your Steel Pickaxe to look for Rough Garnet deep beneath these mines, below the copper and jade, and bring me two pieces. Pack food and see that you have light. Keep a route back to the surface. I count a trip successful when the stone and the miner both come back up; one without the other is just paperwork.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "giver_name": "Kelda Screesort",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarncut Mine",
   "id": "frostbarrow_cutting_03",
   "min_level": 26,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 2 grug_materials:rough_garnet"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 2,
     "item": "grug_materials:rough_garnet",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "frostbarrow_cutting_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Bring Yourself Back Too",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "xp": 480
  },
  {
   "copper": 45,
   "description": "From the watch I count fresh tracks every night in the Frostbarrow Rimewood, which lies in the north of Frostbarrow Shelf, and every one of them belongs to a Crag Snow Leopard. Kill six there after dark if you've the nerve and the hours. Nobody will order you to, which is why I'm asking nicely.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_026_host",
   "giver_name": "Hedra Rimebell",
   "giver_settlement": "Rimebell Watch",
   "id": "frostbarrow_watch_optional",
