   "title": "Bounty: Claws with the Tide (repeatable)",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_026_host",
   "xp": 425
  },
  {
   "copper": 64,
   "description": "Goblin Powder-Counter Nib stole our blasting powder and is counting the barrels in the Frostbarrow Rimewood north from here. Go by daylight, when the leopards there have bedded down and only rams and the odd eagle are about. Clear your approach first, then pull Nib away from his barrels and fight him alone; he hits like a goblin who knows exactly how much powder he has left. Kill him before he finishes his sums.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_061_host",
   "giver_name": "Kelda Screesort",
   "giver_settlement": "Tarncut Mine",
   "id": "frostbarrow_cutting_04",
